WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

01:57.740 --> 02:01.610
<b>Rieko! You’re going way too fast!</b>

02:03.820 --> 02:05.880
<b>I need to deliver these handouts...</b>

02:05.880 --> 02:08.950
<b>Ah, for Kobayakawa and Tanigawa, right?</b>

02:08.950 --> 02:11.190
<b>You can just do that later.</b>

02:11.190 --> 02:12.520
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:12.520 --> 02:15.890
<b>And don’t you think it’s a waste
for those two, anyway?</b>

02:15.890 --> 02:17.260
<b>You sure said it.</b>

02:17.260 --> 02:19.330
<b>Who knows when they’ll come back?</b>

02:19.330 --> 02:22.900
<b>But... Sensei asked me to, so...</b>

02:22.900 --> 02:26.940
<b>Just forget about those guys
who don’t come to school.</b>

02:26.940 --> 02:29.440
<b>Leave them alone.</b>

02:29.440 --> 02:31.480
<b>There’s no reason to take that tone...</b>

02:32.140 --> 02:36.980
<b>Shigeki and Kisa are both missing
school for their own reasons...</b>

02:39.620 --> 02:43.750
<b>Speaking honestly for a sec,
this part of you is pretty annoying.</b>

02:45.120 --> 02:47.160
<b>Forget this. Let’s go.</b>

02:47.160 --> 02:48.230
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:55.790 --> 03:02.760
<b>What It Means To Be A Good Girl</b>

03:49.790 --> 03:51.390
<b>Hello!</b>

03:52.920 --> 03:54.230
<b>You’re here pretty early today.</b>

03:54.230 --> 03:56.460
<b>Y-Yeah.</b>

04:02.200 --> 04:04.670
<b>If you’re looking for Shigeki,
he hasn’t been here.</b>

04:04.670 --> 04:06.200
<b>I wasn’t really...</b>

04:06.200 --> 04:10.210
<b>Then if you’re looking for the tenant,
I think she’s still upstairs.</b>

04:11.610 --> 04:14.010
<b>Mind if I go up for a bit?</b>

04:14.850 --> 04:17.250
<b>Er, or should I start preparing?</b>

04:17.250 --> 04:19.350
<b>I told you it was still pretty early, didn’t I?</b>

04:19.350 --> 04:21.150
<b>Yeah. Well, then...</b>

04:34.330 --> 04:35.700
<b>Yes?</b>

04:35.700 --> 04:38.040
<b>Umm... it’s Yamato...</b>

04:39.200 --> 04:42.240
<b>Rieko-chan? What’s up?</b>

04:42.240 --> 04:45.510
<b>There’s just something
I wanted to ask you...</b>

04:46.950 --> 04:48.510
<b>Let’s talk downstairs...</b>

04:48.510 --> 04:50.110
<b>Could you wait for me down there?</b>

04:50.120 --> 04:51.780
<b>Ah... yes.</b>

04:51.780 --> 04:53.580
<b>I’ll be right down.</b>

04:56.890 --> 04:58.220
<b>She wants to ask me something?</b>

05:11.670 --> 05:13.300
<b>So... what did you want to talk about?</b>

05:15.170 --> 05:16.470
<b>Umm...</b>

05:25.250 --> 05:28.690
<b>It’s about Shige– Kobayakawa-kun...</b>

05:30.460 --> 05:33.620
<b>Ah, the friend of the girl with the evil.</b>

05:33.630 --> 05:35.260
<b>Something happen?</b>

05:35.260 --> 05:36.830
<b>“Evil”?</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:41.400
<b>It’s what I call the thing that girl...
that Tanigawa-san kept.</b>

05:42.430 --> 05:46.940
<b>Have you met with Kobayakawa-kun...
since that happened?</b>

05:46.940 --> 05:51.410
<b>He doesn’t seem to want to meet with me...
Though it seems like that boy did.</b>

05:51.410 --> 05:52.440
<b>“That boy”?</b>

05:52.440 --> 05:54.380
<b>You know, that small boy.</b>

05:54.380 --> 05:56.380
<b>Makki... Makabe-kun?</b>

05:56.380 --> 05:57.350
<b>Yeah, him.</b>

05:57.350 --> 06:01.120
<b>If you have some business with Kobayakawa-kun, why don’t you ask him?</b>

06:01.120 --> 06:04.860
<b>I see... Makki’s met with him...</b>

06:05.820 --> 06:07.960
<b>Umm... how about with Tanigawa-san?</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:09.960
<b>Look here...</b>

06:09.960 --> 06:11.800
<b>Why are you asking me this stuff?</b>

06:11.800 --> 06:14.600
<b>They’re your friends, right?
Why don’t you just contact them yourself?</b>

06:16.540 --> 06:18.970
<b>Sukawara-san...</b>

06:18.970 --> 06:21.570
<b>Why are you trying to meet them?</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:23.110
<b>Research.</b>

06:23.110 --> 06:26.440
<b>I want to talk to them in person and hear what
they have to say about some things.</b>

06:26.450 --> 06:27.950
<b>But if you can’t meet with them?</b>

06:27.950 --> 06:30.350
<b>Or if you do and they won’t
tell you anything?</b>

06:31.580 --> 06:35.690
<b>In those cases, it just can’t be helped.</b>

06:35.690 --> 06:36.520
<b>That’s it?</b>

06:36.520 --> 06:38.990
<b>Well, I do have other things to do.</b>

06:38.990 --> 06:41.530
<b>And I won’t force them to talk if they don’t want to.</b>

06:41.530 --> 06:43.760
<b>I’ll just wait for the next chance I get.</b>

07:07.150 --> 07:10.250
<b>Umm... I’ll be back later.</b>

07:11.660 --> 07:14.290
<b>Let’s finish this another time, okay?</b>

07:14.560 --> 07:15.660
<b>I’m off!</b>

07:18.700 --> 07:21.900
<b>Really... that woman is
quite the busybody.</b>

07:40.420 --> 07:41.820
<b>Hey, you!</b>

07:44.890 --> 07:47.530
<b>Wait a sec!</b>

07:53.570 --> 07:55.900
<b>Let’s talk a little.</b>

08:00.040 --> 08:04.040
<b>Tanigawa-san’s stuck in your head too, isn’t she?</b>

08:04.040 --> 08:04.680
<b>“Too”?</b>

08:04.680 --> 08:06.940
<b>Yes. She’s also stuck in
Aizawa-kun’s head.</b>

08:06.950 --> 08:08.050
<b>That guy...</b>

08:08.050 --> 08:11.150
<b>Even if he’s worried now,
it’s way too late!</b>

08:12.920 --> 08:14.190
<b>Isn’t it the same with you?</b>

08:14.920 --> 08:20.160
<b>It’s too late for him to worry,
but it’s not too late for you?</b>

08:20.830 --> 08:27.470
<b>Well, I don’t really care
who’s worried about what.</b>

08:27.470 --> 08:30.170
<b>So, have you heard?</b>

08:30.170 --> 08:31.240
<b>Heard what?</b>

08:31.240 --> 08:35.740
<b>How Tanigawa-san got that thing...</b>

08:35.740 --> 08:38.940
<b>If you know, I’d love to hear about it...</b>

08:38.940 --> 08:40.180
<b>I don’t.</b>

08:40.180 --> 08:42.710
<b>And even if I did, I wouldn’t tell you.</b>

08:45.450 --> 08:47.350
<b>These guys sure are young...</b>

09:03.100 --> 09:05.270
<b>I’ll help.</b>

09:05.270 --> 09:07.100
<b>What should I start with?</b>

09:07.110 --> 09:08.610
<b>Let’s see...</b>

09:08.610 --> 09:11.040
<b>How about you start by telling me what’s going on?</b>

09:13.710 --> 09:14.510
<b>With what?</b>

09:15.050 --> 09:18.750
<b>Like the reason you look
like you’re brooding.</b>

09:18.750 --> 09:21.390
<b>It’s nothing, really...</b>

09:21.390 --> 09:24.050
<b>It’s Shigeki, isn’t it?</b>

09:36.840 --> 09:38.000
<b>I...</b>

09:39.670 --> 09:41.940
<b>I...</b>

09:41.940 --> 09:45.180
<b>...don’t know what to do anymore.</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:52.450
<b>I’ve tried going to him...
but nothing’s gone well at all...</b>

09:56.520 --> 09:57.660
<b>You see...</b>

09:59.990 --> 10:03.930
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting...
Something suddenly came up.</b>

10:06.670 --> 10:09.900
<b>Now then, off to work...</b>

10:11.140 --> 10:12.440
<b>You don’t have to work today.</b>

10:12.440 --> 10:13.870
<b>Go on home, Rieko.</b>

10:13.870 --> 10:15.570
<b>I’m fine.</b>

10:15.570 --> 10:18.010
<b>When you’re like that,
you won’t be able to work.</b>

10:19.540 --> 10:22.280
<b>That’s not a face to serve customers with.</b>

10:24.180 --> 10:25.620
<b>Fine...</b>

10:38.600 --> 10:40.200
<b>Did something happen...?</b>

10:40.200 --> 10:42.970
<b>Probably.</b>

10:42.970 --> 10:47.410
<b>Would it have been better
if I hadn’t returned?</b>

10:47.410 --> 10:50.210
<b>That has nothing to do with this.</b>

10:50.210 --> 10:52.620
<b>Nothing would’ve happened with that girl’s problem...</b>

10:52.620 --> 10:56.410
<b>...whether or not you walked in
when you did.</b>

10:57.220 --> 10:59.920
<b>That girl... Shigeki...</b>

10:59.920 --> 11:04.660
<b>In the end, people have to handle
these types of things themselves.</b>

11:30.200 --> 11:32.200
<b>Makki</b>

11:34.620 --> 11:37.890
<b>I cannot answer the phone right now, so please–</b>

11:47.750 --> 11:52.730
<b>Mayu-chan</b>

11:47.750 --> 11:52.730
<b>Shigeki</b>

11:47.750 --> 11:52.730
<b>Yuu</b>

