<b>Makki</b>

13:51.120 --> 13:52.190
<b>What?</b>

13:52.190 --> 13:54.430
<b>Umm... I’m sorry for calling
suddenly like this.</b>

13:54.430 --> 13:56.590
<b>What’s up with all these calls?</b>

13:56.600 --> 13:57.800
<b>Umm...</b>

13:57.800 --> 14:00.630
<b>If you have no business with me,
would you please stop calling?</b>

14:00.630 --> 14:04.400
<b>It’s just... there was this thing
I had to ask you...</b>

14:04.870 --> 14:06.070
<b>What is it?</b>

14:06.070 --> 14:10.270
<b>Rieko-chan, if there were a place you’d go
when you were depressed, where would it be?</b>

14:11.780 --> 14:13.210
<b>Are you trying to pick a fight?</b>

14:13.210 --> 14:15.010
<b>No, not at all...</b>

14:15.010 --> 14:16.210
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

14:16.210 --> 14:17.820
<b>Why are you apologizing?</b>

14:17.820 --> 14:21.120
<b>I... didn’t think you’d get so angry.</b>

14:21.120 --> 14:22.390
<b>I’m not angry.</b>

14:22.390 --> 14:24.790
<b>I see... that’s good.</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:27.020
<b>Though I’m pretty annoyed.</b>

14:27.030 --> 14:29.090
<b>I’m sorry...</b>

14:29.090 --> 14:31.360
<b>Why don’t you just think
about that yourself?</b>

14:31.360 --> 14:32.730
<b>What?</b>

14:32.730 --> 14:34.630
<b>You said it yourself, didn’t you?</b>

14:34.630 --> 14:37.030
<b>Where you’d go when you’re depressed.</b>

14:37.040 --> 14:39.440
<b>Yeah... umm.</b>

14:39.440 --> 14:43.410
<b>It’s just that I don’t even know if
Tanigawa-san is home or not...</b>

14:43.410 --> 14:47.610
<b>...so I was wondering where you’d go if
you were in the same situation as her...</b>

14:48.510 --> 14:49.580
<b>Kisa...</b>

14:49.580 --> 14:51.680
<b>What? What did you say?</b>

14:51.680 --> 14:55.490
<b>Hey, is it true that you met with Shigeki?</b>

14:55.490 --> 14:57.220
<b>Kobayakawa-kun?</b>

14:57.220 --> 14:58.690
<b>I wouldn’t exactly say I “met” with him...</b>

14:58.690 --> 15:00.420
<b>Just answer the question.</b>

15:00.430 --> 15:02.390
<b>I just ran into him,
and tried to talk with him.</b>

15:02.390 --> 15:03.430
<b>That’s all?</b>

15:03.430 --> 15:05.600
<b>I tried to talk with him, and he got mad.</b>

15:05.600 --> 15:10.070
<b>Now that I have something I want to talk
to him about, he won’t answer the phone.</b>

15:14.940 --> 15:16.140
<b>What?</b>

15:16.140 --> 15:21.080
<b>I... was just thinking that maybe
if you called him, he’d answer...</b>

15:23.120 --> 15:24.880
<b>Hello?</b>

15:24.880 --> 15:26.050
<b>Why do you think he would?</b>

15:26.050 --> 15:28.090
<b>You two are on good terms, after all.</b>

15:28.090 --> 15:29.050
<b>Is that sarcasm?</b>

15:29.050 --> 15:30.390
<b>Why would it be?</b>

15:30.390 --> 15:31.520
<b>Because...</b>

15:31.520 --> 15:37.830
<b>Because you’re the one who’s
closest to him, Rieko-chan.</b>

15:37.830 --> 15:39.400
<b>You think so?</b>

15:39.400 --> 15:40.530
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:44.270 --> 15:46.770
<b>You said you had something you
needed to talk to Shigeki about?</b>

15:46.770 --> 15:47.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:47.540 --> 15:49.870
<b>All right. I’ll work with you on this one.</b>

15:49.880 --> 15:51.980
<b>I also have some business with Shigeki.</b>

15:51.980 --> 15:52.980
<b>Thanks.</b>

15:52.980 --> 15:55.810
<b>Once I get in touch with him,
I’ll send you a text message.</b>

15:55.810 --> 15:56.710
<b>I’ll be waiting.</b>

15:56.720 --> 15:58.480
<b>Bye.</b>

16:18.470 --> 16:20.240
<b>What do you want already?
Jesus Christ.</b>

16:21.610 --> 16:22.770
<b>Riezo?</b>

16:22.770 --> 16:25.080
<b>Yeah... are you free right now?</b>

16:25.080 --> 16:26.410
<b>What is it?</b>

16:26.410 --> 16:29.850
<b>Our teacher gave me some handouts to give to you...</b>

16:29.850 --> 16:31.850
<b>I was wondering if you want
to meet somewhere now?</b>

16:34.620 --> 16:35.720
<b>No?</b>

16:36.720 --> 16:39.390
<b>Just put it in my mailbox.</b>

16:42.230 --> 16:44.560
<b>Did you hear me?</b>

16:44.560 --> 16:46.360
<b>Okay...</b>

16:50.050 --> 16:50.090
<b>I'm leaving to go meet
