17:49.800 --> 17:51.400
<b>Shigeki!</b>

17:52.760 --> 17:55.170
<b>Why are you running away?!</b>

18:14.290 --> 18:17.560
<b>Here are the handouts from school.</b>

18:17.560 --> 18:18.560
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:22.030 --> 18:25.230
<b>Why... did you leave earlier?</b>

18:25.230 --> 18:27.570
<b>Why?</b>

18:27.570 --> 18:28.730
<b>No reason, really...</b>

18:28.730 --> 18:33.170
<b>I thought that maybe you needed to
speak privately with Hana-san...</b>

18:33.170 --> 18:33.940
<b>No...</b>

18:35.140 --> 18:39.510
<b>And then I thought you left because
Sukawara-san and I were there...</b>

18:39.510 --> 18:41.150
<b>There’s that.</b>

18:41.150 --> 18:42.350
<b>So it’s true...</b>

18:42.350 --> 18:44.780
<b>I’m... no good when it comes
to that person.</b>

18:44.780 --> 18:46.420
<b>Sukawara-san?</b>

18:46.420 --> 18:47.650
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:52.890 --> 18:55.830
<b>Shigeki... you’ve lost some weight.</b>

18:57.160 --> 18:58.900
<b>Are you sleeping properly?</b>

19:00.230 --> 19:02.070
<b>It just seems like...</b>

19:02.070 --> 19:04.600
<b>...everyone’s changed
since <i>that</i> happened.</b>

19:05.200 --> 19:06.800
<b>Since what happened?</b>

19:06.810 --> 19:09.910
<b>I’ve only heard about it
secondhand, but...</b>

19:09.910 --> 19:12.180
<b>Since Kisa’s thing...</b>

19:12.180 --> 19:13.580
<b>Bun-chan...</b>

19:13.580 --> 19:17.850
<b>It’s natural to be concerned about Kisa.</b>

19:17.850 --> 19:24.160
<b>I... can’t say I completely understand
your feelings, but I can try...</b>

19:24.160 --> 19:26.760
<b>And I want to.
I want to be there for you.</b>

19:27.960 --> 19:32.060
<b>You really are the class rep type,
aren’t you?</b>

19:33.230 --> 19:34.800
<b>I’ve grown sick of this.</b>

19:34.800 --> 19:36.430
<b>Shigeki...</b>

19:36.440 --> 19:39.770
<b>If you want to be there for me,
then leave me alone.</b>

19:40.310 --> 19:42.870
<b>I’ll be more appreciative that way.</b>

19:42.870 --> 19:45.540
<b>Kisa, Kisa...</b>

19:45.540 --> 19:47.910
<b>Kisa, Kisa, Kisa!</b>

19:47.910 --> 19:49.450
<b>Why?!</b>

19:49.450 --> 19:51.180
<b>Kisa’s fragile.</b>

19:51.180 --> 19:53.450
<b>She’s so easy to break, and so clumsy...</b>

19:53.450 --> 19:55.820
<b>You don’t understand a thing...</b>

19:55.820 --> 19:58.760
<b>I thought you saw her better than that.</b>

19:58.760 --> 20:00.860
<b>I do.</b>

20:00.860 --> 20:05.730
<b>I push myself a little to mingle
with everyone around me...</b>

20:05.730 --> 20:08.730
<b>...and I’m always scared of being hated by them...</b>

20:08.730 --> 20:13.540
<b>But Kisa’s not scared
of being hated at all!</b>

20:13.540 --> 20:15.640
<b>Kisa’s strong!</b>

20:15.640 --> 20:18.440
<b>You’re the one who doesn’t understand anything.</b>

20:18.440 --> 20:20.680
<b>Even if she’s strong in that sense...</b>

20:20.680 --> 20:22.450
<b>...it doesn’t mean that she’s not
easily breakable and clumsy.</b>

20:25.320 --> 20:26.220
<b>I hate you...</b>

20:28.020 --> 20:30.050
<b>I hate you <i>and</i> Kisa!</b>

20:34.960 --> 20:35.890
<b>Rieko-chan!</b>

20:52.910 --> 20:54.250
<b>Rieko-chan!</b>

21:13.570 --> 21:15.270
<b>Huh?</b>

21:15.270 --> 21:16.170
<b>Umm...</b>

21:19.140 --> 21:20.600
<b>Here it is.</b>

21:20.610 --> 21:22.090
<b>Wanna use this?</b>

21:25.910 --> 21:27.540
<b>Are you okay?</b>

21:28.080 --> 21:30.110
<b>No, I’m not.</b>

21:36.490 --> 21:37.890
<b>This is the worst.</b>

21:38.390 --> 21:40.520
<b>I have patience, and I worry...</b>

21:40.530 --> 21:44.300
<b>I’m such an idiot for worrying about everyone else.</b>

21:46.970 --> 21:47.630
<b>Umm...</b>

21:47.630 --> 21:49.500
<b>This has nothing to do with you, Makki.</b>

21:50.970 --> 21:52.640
<b>Uh...</b>

21:52.640 --> 21:54.510
<b>I don’t know what happened, but...</b>

21:54.510 --> 21:55.440
<b>Just shut up!</b>

21:58.410 --> 21:59.810
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

21:59.810 --> 22:02.610
<b>Like I’ve been saying, quit apologizing
for every little thing!</b>

22:02.610 --> 22:05.320
<b>Rieko... chan?</b>

22:05.320 --> 22:10.390
<b>I’ve... had enough of this.</b>

22:10.390 --> 22:11.660
<b>Umm...</b>

22:11.660 --> 22:14.290
<b>I’m going home.
Don’t follow me.</b>

22:44.220 --> 22:46.890
<b>Bun... chan...?</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.990 --> 24:22.940
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:20.450 --> 24:22.790
<b>Next time: “What Vanished and What Was Born.”</b>

24:22.790 --> 24:23.620
<b>Look forward to it.</b>

24:23.620 --> 24:27.360
<b>Hey, Rokkun! Why’d you say the
next episode title so suddenly?</b>

24:27.360 --> 24:28.790
<b>Ah, I just felt like it, so...</b>

24:28.790 --> 24:30.290
<b>Is this really something you can fix with “I felt like it”?</b>

24:30.300 --> 24:32.900
<b>If you’re so concerned with it,
I’ll just give it a cool new title.</b>

24:32.900 --> 24:33.460
<b>Let’s see...</b>

24:33.470 --> 24:35.570
<b>“Farewell, Beautiful Old Lady Okaka.” How’s that?</b>

24:35.570 --> 24:36.800
<b>Then how about one for me?</b>

24:36.800 --> 24:38.540
<b>“The Riddle of Phantom Beautiful Girl, Taruto.”</b>

24:39.170 --> 24:40.970
<b>How about “Okaka Vanishes Into the Twilight.”</b>

24:40.970 --> 24:44.280
<b>“Taruto’s Love and Journey.”</b>

24:42.370 --> 24:45.980
<b>“Final Wars: Roku, Destroy that Planet.”</b>

24:44.280 --> 24:47.110
<b>“The Stir-Fry Okaka that Vanished Into the Darkness.”</b>

24:45.980 --> 24:49.210
<b>“The Birth of the Gorgeous Star, Taruto!”</b>

24:47.110 --> 24:49.210
<b>“Faithful Dog Roku’s Rokudenashi Blues!”</b>

24:49.210 --> 24:51.280
<b>“Sortie! Robo-Okaka #1!”</b>

24:50.580 --> 24:53.050
<b>“Taruto Forever...”</b>

24:51.280 --> 24:54.350
<b>“Space Battleship Roku, A New Journey.”</b>

24:53.050 --> 24:55.920
<b>“Sadness is Like Okaka...”</b>

24:54.350 --> 24:58.220
<b>“The Beginning of a Strange and Depressing Taruto.”</b>

24:55.020 --> 24:59.950
<b>What Vanished and What Was Born</b>

24:55.920 --> 24:58.220
<b>“Roku, Roku, Roku and Roll!”</b>
